# Who must review changes to which files. Turn on "Require review from Code Owners"
# in your branch ruleset so these reviews are required.
# Replace the names with your own GitHub users or teams.

# Default reviewer for everything.
*                       @your-org/maintainers

# Automation and deployment: only your most trusted people.
/.github/               @your-org/admins
/deploy/                @your-org/admins

# Anything that handles money, personal data or sign-in.
/src/payments/          @your-org/admins
/src/auth/              @your-org/admins

# The volunteer task list and rules.
/volunteer-compute.yaml @your-org/maintainers
/AGENTS.md              @your-org/maintainers
